EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} it's noisy in here!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
These little guys sure make a lot of
