EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I like to come and visit these bugs{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
because I feel like they'd do the
same for me if I were in a museum.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mi piace far visita a questi insetti.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
